# Windows-only project: store LF in Git, check out CRLF for every contributor
# regardless of their core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=crlf
# Except GitHub configuration: Dependabot commits files exactly as its checkout reads
# them, so a CRLF checkout turned every line of a workflow into a change.
/.github/** text eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch line endings or diff as text.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.zip binary
*.msix binary
*.pfx binary
*.p12 binary
